<title>USA: Applied Power completes Hormann acquisition.</title>
<headline>Applied Power completes Hormann acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Power Inc said Friday it has completed the acquisition electronic equipment assembler Hormann Security Systems Ltd for about $10 million.</p>
<p>Hormann, headquartered in Cork, Ireland, has total annual sales of about $30 million, Applied Power said.</p>
<p>The company will be integrated into Applied Power's Technical Environments and Enclosures segment, Applied Power said.</p>
<p>Applied Power shares rose 3/4 to 46-1/8 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
